source: X9.24-3-2017-Test-Vectors-20180129-1.pdf (ASC X9, 2018-01-29, SHA-256 AE9BB01D76EDA32018332F1202A9C2010097ABF0D17D753612B7E612DDD9C4CC), section 2.2, "All Key Usages for Transaction 1 (AES-128 under AES-128 BDK)"; ksn is the InitialKeyID and the counter (0x1)
